{"id":"bCgCPGh4mtNLrvzkbwKjH","fillColor":"#ffcb7f","height":140,"position":{"x":14260,"y":5080},"type":"shape","kind":"block-arrow","width":220,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","attachedFrame":"_eqfURPlC_ByGhpovZk-C","rotation":337},{"fillColor":"#fff59d","height":140,"position":{"x":14460,"y":5420},"type":"shape","kind":"block-arrow","width":220,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","rotation":337},{"fillColor":"transparent","height":100,"position":{"x":16300,"y":5840},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":400,"text":"to do hexes","textFontFamily":"Chewy","textSize":48,"textColor":"#fff","textAlignment":"right"},{"id":"AHyTpclq95kkl5coCbvkA","fillColor":"transparent","height":180,"position":{"x":14860,"y":4860},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":319.99999999999994,"text":"to do's","textColor":"#ffe083","textFontFamily":"Chewy","textSize":96,"textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF"},{"id":"9S-MhC6n76S8e6qpNv4gx","fillColor":"#ffab90","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16520,"y":4960},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"R6fmaJVpBwZ8OuvVQ4yPh","fillColor":"#f67268","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16360,"y":5100},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"\n","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"Gl08T3KutuAGwptgN-tRY","fillColor":"#f9c6d8","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16520,"y":5140},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"qYJVcMjvWPE0kxyzrkl1a","fillColor":"#ffd5c7","height":160,"position":{"x":16180,"y":4900},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":273.84852762101946,"text":"What?\nWho? \nUntil?\nWith whom?","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349,"textAlignment":"left"},{"id":"lFgG-Q2TpdqkficYDs4ZR","fillColor":"#fcd0cc","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16360,"y":5640},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"C4t5XMLr7qaPK1ptaFb-w","fillColor":"#ff8159","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16360,"y":5280},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"DqhwCmLW6uM82pFOs-GgG","fillColor":"#ee568a","height":153.8485276210191,"position":{"x":16520,"y":5680},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":153.84852762101912,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Pirata One","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"kZYEJtGlbnj6OEG18njLF","rotation":349},{"id":"AqTjHeRYMYeiUYxJE-tzb","type":"frame","position":{"x":16860,"y":4860},"width":1800,"height":1260,"attachedElements":["AJMHw3y1hsbPxArhEn0Q0","aI6MIqhco_WTj9qVb1yNy"]},{"id":"AJMHw3y1hsbPxArhEn0Q0","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","fillColor":"#607d8b","position":{"x":16900,"y":4860},"width":1720,"height":120,"text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textSize":56,"textBold":true,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"#ffffff","attachedFrame":"AqTjHeRYMYeiUYxJE-tzb"},{"id":"aI6MIqhco_WTj9qVb1yNy","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","fillColor":"transparent","position":{"x":16920,"y":5030},"width":1680,"height":1060,"text":"🚀 Halloween Retro: How it works in 4 phases\n\n🎯 Purpose: Look back on a sprint or project with a wink. Each phase has its own screen: from what should stop, to what works, to new ideas and finally to concrete to-dos.\n\n1. Stop doing (10 min)\nAction: Everyone copies a rotten tomato, writes down what should stop and throws it at the grumpy pumpkin.\nRule: One thought per tomato. Name habits, not people.\n\n2. Proceed doing (10 min)\nAction: Sweet chocolate bars go to the happy pumpkin: what worked well and should continue?\n\n3. Ideas (10 min)\nAction: Write new ideas on the idea flashes and let them fly off the witch’s broom.\nRule: Collect first, judge later. Bold ideas are welcome.\n\n4. To do’s (15 min)\nAction: Pick the most important tomatoes and ideas, e.g. by dot voting, and turn each into a to do hex in the cauldron: what, who, until when, with whom?\nGoal: 1–3 to-dos that are actually done before the next retro.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nGuide: Walk through the four screens in presentation mode; each frame is one phase.\nSpook master: Keep it playful without losing the serious topics.\nFollow-up: Start the next retro with a look at last time’s to do hexes.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textSize":28,"textAlignment":"left","textColor":"#000000","attachedFrame":"AqTjHeRYMYeiUYxJE-tzb"}]}],"files":[{"mxc":"mxc://neotoolsuite.demo.nordeck.io/YFKdLZQLSSITKkevUWfimzyV","data":""},{"mxc":"mxc://neotoolsuite.demo.nordeck.io/vtMpcXqXAxsWFJYiuGIFZiww","data":""},{"mxc":"mxc://neotoolsuite.demo.nordeck.io/lgixkzjKGmaubycyusBzEQRe","data":""},{"mxc":"mxc://neotoolsuite.demo.nordeck.io/lanGfZXssvBeYzlfGeNYdUVq","data":""}]}}